Package: cncleanr
Title: Parse Compact Numbers in Chinese Data
Version: 0.2.3.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("皓天", "刘", , "wyvern06@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Parses compact numeric values, qualified quantities, and ranges
    commonly found in Chinese tables and spreadsheets. It handles Chinese
    magnitude suffixes, currencies, percentages, full-width characters,
    financial negatives, and configurable missing-value markers while
    reporting values that cannot be parsed safely.
